hadiths[94]{hadithnumber,text}:
"3411","abwmwsyٰ rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myn khda ky qsm kha kr khta hwn kh agr allh chahay tw qsm nh khaon ga awr phr as say bhtr chyz kw nhyn smjhwn ga awr apny qsm ka kfarh ada kyay bghyr awr as say bhtr kam krwn ga۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3412","Hazrat Abdur Rahman bin Samura Radi Allahu Anhu se riwayat hai ke Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya, \Aey Abdur Rahman bin Samura! Hukumt ki talab mat karo"","" kyunki agar woh tumhe talab karne ki bina par di gayi to tum is ke zimedaan thehra diye jaoge"","" aur agar tumhe baghair talab ke mili to us mein tumhari madad ki jayegi. Aur jab tum kisi baat par qasam khao aur us ke siwa kisi aur cheez ko behtar samjho to apni qasam ka kaffara do aur jo behtar hai woh karo.\"" (Bukhari aur Muslim) Ek riwayat mein hai"","" \""Jo behtar hai woh karo aur qasam ka kaffara do.\"""""""
"3413","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs qsm khayay awr as say bhtr chyz kw smjhay tw asay chahyay kh apny qsm ka kfarh day awr wh kray۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3414","anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw byan krtay hwyay frmaya: ”myn khda ky qsm kha kr khta hwn kh tm myn say ksy ka apnay ahl w ayal kay mtalq apny qsm pr qaym rhna khda kay nzdyk as say zyadh gnah hay kh as ka kfarh ada kray۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3415","anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw byan kya kh aap nay frmaya: ”tmhary qsm aysy hwny chahyay js kay baray myn tmhara sathy tm pr yqyn kray۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3416","anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ka arshad nql kya kh qsm khanay walay ky nyt kay mtabq byan ky jayay gy۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3417","aayshh rzy allh anha nay kha kh aayt، \khda tm say tmhary bykar qsmwn ka hsab nhyn lay ga\"" (alqraan 2:225؛ 5:89) \""nhyn، khda ky qsm\"" awr \""han، khda ky qsm\"" jysay fqrwn kay baray myn nazl hwyy thy۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔ shrh alsn myn almsabyh ka lfz hay kh baz nql krnay walwn nay asay aayshh rzy allh anha say rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"3418","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”apnay bapwn ky qsm nh khao، nh apny maon ky، awr nh apnay hryfwn ky (alqraan 2:22 wghyrh، as ka hwalh btwn ya jhwtay mabwdwn ky trf hay) awr allh ky qsm srf as wqt khao jb tm sch bwl rhay hw۔ asay abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3419","abn amr rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay sna: ”jw allh kay swa ksy ky qsm khayay wh mshrk hay۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"3420","brydh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”wfa ky qsm khanay wala hmaray shmar myn say nhyn hay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔ *aamnh۔ khyal kya jata hay kh aatraz as wjh say hay kh yh lfz khda ky ksy sft ka nam nhyn hay، blkh ansanwn kay lyay mqrr krdh frayz myn say ayk hay۔ yh ayk namnasb lfz hay kywnkh as kay astamal say malwm hwta hay kh asay khda ky sfat myn say ayk kay sath hm aahng kya ja rha hay۔"
"3421","anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw byan krtay hwyay frmaya kh agr kwyy khta hay kh myn aslam say aazad hwn، yh balkl asy trh hay jysa kh as nay kha hay kh agr wh jhwt bwl rha hay، lykn agr wh sch bwl rha hay tw wh slamty kay sath aslam myn waps nhyn aayay ga۔ asay abwdaod، nsayy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3422","abw sayd khdry rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay skht qsm khayy tw aap nay frmaya: nhyn، as ky qsm js kay hath myn abw qasm ky jan hay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3423","abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay qsm khayy tw wh yh tha kh nhyn، awr myn allh say maafy mangta hwn۔ abwdaod awr abn majh nay asay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3424","abn amr rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh agr kwyy qsm khatay wqt khay kh agr allh nay chaha tw as say kwyy mwakhzh nhyn kya jayay ga۔ trmzy، abwdaod، nsayy، abn majh awr darmy nay asay nql kya hay، lykn trmzy nay as ka zkr abn amr say zyadh nhyn kya۔"
"3425","abwalahwas awf b۔ malk nay apnay wald ka hwalh dytay hwyay kha kh myn nay kha kh khda kay rswl mjhay btayyay kh myn apnay ayk chcha zad bhayy kay baray myn kya krwn js kay pas myn ja kr kchh mangta hwn lykn jw nh mjhay kchh dyta hay awr nh hy myry rshth dary ka khyal rkhta hay، phr jb wh myry mdd ky zrwrt hw tw myray pas aata hay awr kchh mangta hay awr myn nay qsm khayy hay kh myn asay kchh nhyn dwn ga awr nh hy as ky qrabt ka khyal krwn ga۔ as nay mjhay wh kam krnay ka hkm dya jw bhtr hw awr apny qsm ka kfarh ada kr dwn۔ abn majh ky rwayt myn hay kh as nay kha: \khda kay rswl، myra chcha zad bhayy myray pas aata hay awr myn qsm khata hwn kh myn asay kchh nhyn dwn ga awr nh hy as ky qrabt ka khyal rkhwn ga\"" awr as nay jwab dya، \""apny qsm ka kfarh dw۔\"" asay nsayy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"3426","abwhryrh awr abn amr rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”qsm mt krw، kywnkh nzr ka tqdyr pr kwyy asr nhyn hwta، yh srf bkhl ka zryah hay js say kwyy chyz nkaly jaty hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3427","aayshh rzy allh anha say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”agr kwyy allh ky ataat ky nzr manay tw as ky ataat kray awr agr kwyy as ky nafrmany ky nzr manay tw wh as ky nafrmany nh kray۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"3428","'amran by۔ hsyn rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”nafrmany krnay ky nzr pwry nhyn hwny chahyay، ya kwyy aysa kam kray js pr ksy ka akhtyar nh hw۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔ ayk wrzhn hay، \khda ky nafrmany kay lyay kwyy qsm nhyn athany chahyay۔\"""""""
"3429","aqbh by۔ hzrt aamr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: nzr ka kfarh qsm kay brabr hay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3430","abn abas rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm waz frma rhay thay kh ayk aadmy khra tha، tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay as kay baray myn pwchha، tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay as kay baray myn pwchha tw btaya gya kh yh abw asrayyl hyn، jnhwn nay nzr many thy kh khray hwn gay، nh bythyn gay، nh sayh myn jayyn gay، ya bwlyn gay، blkh rwzh rkhyn gay۔ tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”asay khw kh wh bat kray، sayay myn jayay، byth jayay awr apna rwzh pwra kray۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"3431","ans rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay ayk bwrhay kw apnay bytwn kay drmyan shara dya hwa dykha، jb aap sly allh alyh wslm nay pwchha kh as ka kya maamlh hay awr btaya gya kh aap nay pydl chlnay ky nzr many hay، tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”allh taalyٰ kw as bat ky kwyy zrwrt nhyn kh yh shkhs apnay aap kw sza day“، aap nay asay swar hwnay ka hkm dya۔"
"3432","mslm myn abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”bwrhay aadmy، swar hw ja، kywnkh allh kw aap awr aap ky nzr ka mhtaj nhyn hay۔"
"3433","abn abas nay kha kh sad bn abadh nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say apny waldh ky nzr kay baray myn fyslh tlb kya jw asay pwra krnay say phlay hy fwt hw gyy thy، awr aap sly allh alyh wslm nay an ky trf say asay pwra krnay ka fyslh kya۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3434","kab b۔ malk nay byan kya kh as nay kha، \khda kay rswl، myry twbh kw mkml krnay kay lyay* mjhay khda awr as kay rswl kay lyay sdqh kay twr pr apny jayydad myn say alg kr dyna chahyay۔\"" rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”apny jayydad myn say kchh apnay pas rkh lw، yh tmharay lyay bhtr hay۔ as lyay as nay kha kh wh khybr myn jw hsh an kay pas tha asay brqrar rkhay ga۔ (bkhary w mslm۔) yh ayk twyl rwayt ka hsh hay۔ mrqat، iii، 566 as say mrad bghyr ksy maqwl wjh kay tbwk ky mhm say dstbrdar hw jana hay۔ Pt 10"""""
"3435","aayshh rzy allh anha say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”masyt kay lyay kwyy nzr nhyn ly jayay gy awr as ka kfarh qsm kay brabr hay۔ asay abwdaod، trmzy awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3436","abn abas rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs nzr manay lykn as ka nam nh lay tw as ka kfarh qsm kay brabr hay، agr kwyy masyt ky nzr kray tw as ka kfarh qsm kay brabr hay، agr kwyy nzr manay tw wh pwra nh kr skay tw as ka kfarh why hay jw qsm khayay، lykn agr kwyy nzr manay tw as ka kfarh asy trh hay۔ pwra krnay kay lyay، asay aysa krna chahyay۔\ abwdaod awr abn majh nay asay nql kya hay، lykn baz nay asay abn abas say zyadh pychhay nhyn dykha۔"""""
"3437","sabt b۔ zhak rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay zmanay myn ayk shkhs nay bwanh kay mqam pr awnt zbh krnay ky nzr many awr aa kr aap sly allh alyh wslm kw btaya۔ khda kay rswl nay pwchha kh kya as jgh pr zmanh jahlyt myn kwyy bt mwjwd tha js ky pwja ky jaty thy awr btaya gya kh aysa nhyn hay۔ anhwn nay swal kya kh kya whan qbl az aslam kwyy thwar mnaya gya awr btaya gya kh aysy kwyy chyz nhyn mnayy gyy۔ as kay bad as nay as aadmy say kha kh apny nzr pwry krw kywnkh khda ky nafrmany ky nzr pwry nhyn hwny chahyay awr nh hy kwyy aysa kam krna chahyay js pr ansan ka akhtyar nh hw۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3438","amrw by۔ shayb nay apnay wald ky trf say byan kya kh an kay dada nay ayk awrt kay baray myn btaya js nay kha tha kh \khda kay rswl، myn nay aap pr df bjanay ky nzr many hay\"" js kay jwab myn anhwn nay kha، \""apny nzr pwry krw۔\"" abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔ razyn nay mzyd kha kh as nay kha، \""awr myn nay flan jgh qrbany krnay ky qsm khayy hay،\"" wh jgh jhan lwgwn nay zmanh jahlyt myn qrbanyan ky thyn۔ as nay pwchha kh kya as jgh pr zmanh jahlyt myn kwyy bt mwjwd tha js ky pwja ky jaty thy، tw as nay jwab dya kh aysa nhyn hay۔ as nay pwchha kh kya whan qbl az aslam kwyy thwar mnaya jata tha، tw as nay jwab dya kh aysa kwyy nhyn۔ phr frmaya: apny nzr pwry krw۔ razyn"""""
"3439","abw lbabh nay byan kya kh anhwn nay nby krym sly allh alyh wslm say kha kh apny twbh mkml krnay kay lyay mjhay apny qwm kay as thkanay kw trk kr dyna chahyay js myn myn nay gnah kya hay awr apny tmam jayydad kw sdqh krnay kay lyay alg kr dwn۔ as nay jwab dya: tmharay dynay kay lyay ayk thayy kafy hay۔ razn nay asay mntql kya۔ yh khany abn hsham ky syrt alnbwyh (qahrh، 1355/1936) myn dy gyy hay۔ 247۔ qryzh nay as say mshwrh kya tha kh kya wh ghyr mshrwt twr pr hthyar dal dyn، awr jb as nay jwab dya kh anhyn chahyay، tw as nay apna hath apnay glay pr rkh kr asharh kya kh agr anhwn nay aysa kya tw anhyn mwt kay ghat atar dya jayay ga، as trh anhyn warnng dy۔ alqraan، 8:27 ka talq as waqah say btaya jata hay۔"
"3440","jabr by۔ abdallh nay byan kya kh fth kay dn ayk shkhs nay ath kr kha: aay khda kay rswl myn nay khda ky qsm khayy hay jw azym awr bzrg hay kh agr khda aap kay hathwn mkh kw fth krta hay tw myn byt almqds myn dw rkat nmaz prhwn ga۔ as nay jwab dya yhan nmaz prhw۔ as nay as say apna byan dhraya awr as nay jwab dya kh yhan nmaz prhw۔ as nay dwbarh asay dhraya awr as nay jwab dya، \tw phr apna rasth akhtyar krw۔\"" asay abwdaod awr darmy nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"3441","abn abas rzy allh anhma nay byan kya kh aqbh rzy allh anh ky bhn۔ amyr nay pydl hj krnay ky mnt many lykn aysa nh kr ska۔ phr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”allh kw tmhary bhn kay chlnay ky zrwrt nhyn hay، lhza asay swary day awr qrbany ka awnt pysh kray۔ *arby bwdana abwdaod ky ayk rwayt myn hay kh nby sly allh alyh wslm nay asay swary ka hkm dya tha awr qrbany kay janwr pysh kyay thay۔* an kay ayk awr nskhay myn nby krym sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: tmhary bhn apnay awpr jw msybt laty hay as say allh kw kwyy faydh nhyn hwta، lhza asay swary pr hj krnay awr apny qsm ka kfarh ada krnay dw۔ abwdaod۔ *arby hady"
"3442","abdallh by۔ malk nay btaya kh jb aqbh bn amyr nay nby sly allh alyh wslm say apny ayk bhn kay baray myn mshwrh kya js nay hj ky nzr many thy۔ agr nngay paon awr nngay sr hwn tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”asay hkm dw kh sr dhanpay awr swary kray awr tyn dn kay rwzay rkhay۔ abwdaod، trmzy، nsayy، abn majh awr darmy nay asay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3443","sayd by۔ msyb nay byan kya kh ansar myn dw bhayy thay jw wrast myn shryk thay awr jb an myn say ayk nay dwsray say as ka hsh manga tw as nay jwab dya kh agr tm mjh say dwbarh apna hsh mangw gay tw myra sara mal khanh kabh kay lyay wqf hw jayay ga۔ as nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna tha kh \rb ky nafrmany ky qsm ya nzr، rshth twrna، ya ksy aysy chyz kay baray myn js pr ksy ka akhtyar nhyn hay tm pr lazm nhyn hay۔\"" abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔ 1. fy rtj alkabh۔ yh jmlh jw kabh kay drwazay ky bat krta hay khwd kabh kay lyay astamal hwta hay۔ 2. mrqat، iii، 570 khta hay kh as ka mtlb hay kh wh apnay bhayy say apny drkhwast dhranay kay baray myn bat kray۔"""""
"3444","'amran by۔ hsyn rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna kh nzryn dw qsm ky hwty hyn، ps agr kwyy nzr manay tw wh allh kay lyay hay awr asay pwra krna zrwry hay، lykn agr kwyy nzr manay tw wh masyt ka kam kray ga، wh shytan kay lyay hay awr asay pwra nhyn krna chahyay، lykn js hd tk wh kray as ka kfarh ada kray۔"
"3445","mhmd by almntshr nay ayk aysay shkhs kay baray myn btaya js nay apnay aap kw qrban krnay ky qsm khayy thy agr khda asay as kay dshmn say bcha lay۔ as nay abn abas say mshwrh kya jnhwn nay msrwq say mshwrh krnay kw kha tw anhwn nay an say mshwrh kya tw anhwn nay jwab dya kh apnay aap kw qrban nh krw kywnkh agr tw mwmn hay tw ayk mwmn kw qtl kray ga awr agr kafr hay tw jhnm myn jayay ga lykn ayk myndha khryd kr ghrybwn kay lyay qrban krday kywnkh ashaq tjh say bhtr tha awr asay abas rzy allh anh say kha gya tha jwab dya، \yh why fyslh hay jw myn aap kw dyna chahta hwn۔\"" razn nay asay mntql kya۔ *yh pranay ahd namay ky as khany say atfaq krta hay js myn kha gya hay kh abrahym ashaq kw qrban krnay ky tyary kr rhay thay، jbkh mslmanwn ka mamwl yh hay kh yh asmaayl thay۔"""""
"3446","abdallh by۔ msawd rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”as mslman ka khwn jw as bat ky gwahy day kh allh kay swa kwyy mabwd nhyn awr myn allh ka rswl hwn، hlal nhyn hw skta lykn tyn wjwhat myn say ksy ayk ky wjh say: zndgy kay bdlay zndgy، shady shdh mrd jw zna krta hay، awr jw apnay dyn say phr jata hay awr maashray kw chhwr dyta hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3447","abn amr rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”mwmn kw apnay dyn myn as wqt tk wsat mlty rhay gy jb tk kh wh ksy kw nahq qtl nh kray۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"3448","abdallh by۔ msawd rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”qyamt kay dn sb say phla khwn bhana hwga js ka fyslh kya jayay ga۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3449","almqdad b۔ aswd nay byan kya kh as nay kha kh mjhay btayyay kh myn ksy kafr say mlwn awr hm aaps myn lryn awr as nay myra ayk hath apny tlwar say mara awr asay kat dala، phr mjh say pnah kay lyay ayk drkht ky trf bhaga awr khta hay kh as nay apnay aap kw khda kay sprd kr dya hay (ya dwsry rwayt myn khta hay kh jb myn asay qtl krnay ka aradh rkhta hwn kh as kay qtl kay bad kwyy mabwd nhyn hay) tw as nay kha kh myn asay marwn ga؟ as nay jwab dya kh asay qtl nh krw۔ as nay ahtjaj kya lykn aay khda kay rswl as nay myra ayk hath kat dya۔ phr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ’’asay qtl nh krw، kywnkh agr tm aysa krw gay tw wh as mqam pr hw jayay ga js pr tm asay qtl krnay say phlay thay، awr tm as mqam pr hw gay js pr wh gwahy dynay say phlay tha۔‘‘* (bkhary w mslm)* yany wh ab wh hw ga js kay qtl ka bdlh lya jayay ga، awr tm wh hw gay js ka khwn jayz twr pr bhaya jayay ga۔"
"3450","asamh by zyd rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay hmyn jhynh kay kchh lwgwn kay pas bhyja، myn nay an myn say ayk pr hmlh kya awr as pr nyzh dalnay hy wala tha kh as nay kha: allh kay swa kwyy mabwd nhyn۔ phr myn nay asay nyzh day kr qtl kr dya، as kay bad myn nay ja kr nbyﷺ kw btaya۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”kya tm nay asay qtl kya tha jb as nay gwahy dy thy kh allh kay swa kwyy mabwd nhyn؟ myn nay jwab dya، \khda kay rswl، as nay yh srf mwt say bchnay kay lyay kya tha۔\"" as nay pwchha tm nay as ka dl kywn nhyn phar dya؟ bkhary w mslm۔"""""
"3451","jndb kay wrzhn myn b۔ abdallh albjly nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw kyy bar frmaya kh jb qyamt ka dn aayay ga tw tm 'allh kay swa kwyy mabwd nhyn' kay sath kya slwk krw gay؟ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3452","abdallh by۔ amrw rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs ksy aysay aadmy kw qtl kr day js nay ahd kya hw tw asay jnt ky khwshbw nhyn mlay gy، albth as ky khwshbw chalys sal ky msaft pr mhsws ky ja skty hay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔ *maahd۔ yh mhfwz kmywntyz kay rkn kay lyay astamal kya jata hay، lykn yh ksy aysay shkhs kay lyay bhy astamal hwta hay jw ksy ghyr mslm kmywnty say talq rkhta hw js kay sath amn ka maahdh kya gya hw۔"
"3453","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs phar say gr kr apnay aap kw maray ga wh jhnm ky aag myn gra dya jayay ga awr hmyshh as myn rhay ga، js nay zhr pya awr apnay aap kw qtl kya as kay hath myn zhr hay awr asay hmyshh kay lyay jhnm ky aag myn pyta rhay ga، awr js nay apnay aap kw qtl kya as kay hath myn lwhay kay tkray hwn gay۔ hmyshh kay lyay jhnm ky aag myn as kay pyt myn chhra ghwnpa۔‘‘ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3454","anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh aap nay frmaya: ”js nay apna gla ghwnt lya wh jhnm myn hw ga awr js nay apnay andr nyzh dala wh jhnm myn hw ga۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"3455","jndb b۔ abdallh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh an lwgwn myn say jw an kay zmanay say phlay gzray thay، an myn say ayk shkhs aysa tha jsay zkhm tha awr asay brdasht krnay ky atny km sbr thy kh as nay chhry lay ly js say as ka hath kt gya، lykn khwn bhna bnd nh hwa yhan tk kh wh mr gya۔ khdayay bzrg w brtr nay frmaya kh myray bnday nay apny jan lynay myn mjh say sbqt lay janay ky kwshsh ky tw myn nay asay jnt say kharj kr dya۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3456","jabr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay mdynh hjrt frmayy tw tfyl bn۔ amrw aldwsy nay bhy aysa hy kya as kay sath as ky ayk qwm bymar hw gyy awr asay brdasht krnay ky atny km sbr thy kh as nay as kay kchh tyr nkalay js say as ky anglywn kw kat dya awr as kay hath khwn say bhh gyay yhan tk kh wh mr gya۔ phr tfyl by۔ amr rzy allh anh nay khwab myn asay khwb swrty kay sath dykha awr asay apnay hath dhanpay hwyay dykha، tw as nay as say kha: tyray rb nay tyray sath kya kya؟ as nay jwab dya kh as nay mjhay apnay nby ky trf hjrt krnay ky wjh say bkhsh dya۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay pwchha kh myn aap kw apnay hath dhanptay hwyay kysay dykh rha hwnaap sly allh alyh wslm nay jwab dya kh aap sly allh alyh wslm say kha gya hay kh aap nay jw khrab kya hay hm asay drst nhyn kryn gay۔"
"3457","abw shryh alkaby rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”phr tm nay، khzaah nay as hzyl kw qtl kr dya hay، lykn myn khda ky qsm kha kr khta hwn kh myn as kay khwn ka bdlh dwn ga، agr as kay bad kwyy ksy kw qtl kray ga tw as ky qwm kw akhtyar hay kh wh chahyn tw asay qtl kr dyn، ya chahyn tw khwn bha lyn۔ asay trmzy awr shafay nay rwayt kya hay۔ shrh alsn myn as ky snd kay sath mwjwd hay، lykn yh wazh twr pr byan krta hay kh abw shryh ky rwayt say yh dwnwn shyhwn myn mwjwd nhyn hay۔"
"3458","yh khtay hwyay kh anhwn nay asay abwhryrh kay nskhh say nql kya hay، js ka mtlb kchh aysa hy hay۔"
"3459","ans rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh ayk yhwdy nay ayk lrky ka sr dw pthrwn kay drmyan kchl dya awr as say pwchha gya kh as kay sath yh kam ks nay kya hay، flan flan hay ya flan flan، yhan tk kh as yhwdy ka nam lya gya، tw as nay apnay sr say nshan dya۔ yhwdy kw laya gya awr jb as nay aatraf kya tw rswl allh nay hkm dya kh as ka sr pthrwn say kchl dya jayay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3460","anhwn nay kha kh ans rzy allh anh ky phwphy alrbyay۔ malk rzy allh anh nay ansar ky ayk lrky ka agla dant twr dya، jb wh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas gyay tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay antqam lynay ka hkm dya۔ phr ans by۔ alndr، ans bn kay chcha malk rzy allh anh nay kha: nhyn، khda ky qsm، as ka agla dant nhyn twtay ga، allh kay rswl۔ as nay jwab dya: ans، khda ka hkm antqam hay۔ lykn lwg jrmanh qbwl krnay pr razy thay، tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”khda kay bndwn myn say kchh aysay bhy hyn kh agr kwyy khda ky qsm khata hay tw asay qbwl kr lyta hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3461","abw jhyfh khtay hyn kh anhwn nay aly say pwchha kh kya aap kay pas kwyy aysy hdayt hay jw qraan myn mwjwd nhyn hay tw anhwn nay jwab dya: as zat ky qsm js nay byj kw tqsym kya awr rwh kw pyda kya، myray pas as kay swa kchh nhyn hay jw qraan myn hay، swayay as kay kh jw ansan kw as ky ktab awr as ky snd kay baray myn dya gya hay۔ as nay as say pwchha kh as dstawyz myn kya hay، tw as nay jwab dya، \khwn aql، qydy ky rhayy، awr yh kh ksy mslman kw kafr kay bdlay qtl nh kya jayay۔\"" bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"""""
"3462","abdallh by amrw rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”dnya ka rhlt allh kay nzdyk ayk mslman kay qtl say km hay۔ asay trmzy awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔ baz nay as ka sragh srf shaby tk phnchaya، awr yh sb say bhtryn mnzr hay۔"
"3463","abn majh nay asay albraa ky snd say rwayt kya hay۔ azyb۔"
"3464","abwsayd awr abwhryrh rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”agr aasman w zmyn kay rhnay walay ksy mwmn kay khwn myn shryk hwn tw allh anhyn jhnm myn alt day ga۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"3465","abn abas rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”qyamt kay dn mqtwl qtl krnay walay kw as ky pyshany awr as ka sr as kay hath myn lay kr aayay ga، as ky apny rg say khwn tpk rha hw ga، awr wh khay ga kh aay myray rb as nay mjhay qtl kya hay، yhan tk kh asay arsh kay qryb lay aayay ga۔ asay trmzy، nsayy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3466","abw amamh by۔ shl b۔ hnyf nay byan kya kh jb asman bn afan ka mhasrh kya gya as nay nychay dykha awr kha: myn tmhyn khda ky qsm dyta hwn۔ kya aap kw malwm hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \ksy mslman kw qtl krna jayz nhyn swayay tyn wjwhat kay: shady kay bad zna krna، ya aslam qbwl krnay kay bad kfr krna، ya ksy kw nahq qtl krna، js ky wjh say asay qtl kya jayay\""۔ myn khda ky qsm kha kr khta hwn kh myn nay aslam kay aanay say phlay ya bad myn zna nhyn kya، ya jb say myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky byat ky hay، mrtd nhyn hwa، ya myn nay ksy aysay shkhs kw qtl nhyn kya jsay allh nay nafrman qrar dya hay۔ tw aap mjhay ks wjh say marna chahtay hyn؟ asay trmzy، nsayy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay awr darmy nay rwayt ka lfz byan kya hay۔"""""
"3467","abw aldrdaa rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”mwmn as wqt tk tyzy say chlta rhay ga jb tk kh wh ksy kw nahq qtl nh kray، lykn jb wh aysa kray ga tw thk jayay ga۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔ *yany khda kay ahkamat ky tamyl krnay myn jldy awr khda awr ansan ky wjh say achhy trh say mshahdh krna۔"
"3468","anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh frmaya: ”khda hr gnah kw maaf kr skta hay، swayay as kay jw mshrk mray ya ksy mwmn kw jan bwjh kr qtl kray۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3469","nsayy nay asay maawyh say rwayt kya hay۔"
"3470","abn abas rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”msajd myn szayyn nhyn dy jayyn gy awr bytay kay bdlay bap kw qtl nhyn kya jayay ga۔ asay trmzy awr darmy nay nql kya hay۔"
"3471","abw rmsh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn apnay wald kay sath rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky khdmt myn hazr hwa، aap kay yh pwchhnay pr kh yh aap kay sath kwn hay، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”yh myra byta hay، as pr gwah rhw“۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”wh tm pr brayy nhyn layay ga awr nh tm as pr brayy layw gay۔“* asay abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔ * as ky wzaht as many kay twr pr ky gyy hay kh dwnwn myn say ksy kw dwsray kay ghlt kam ky sza nhyn dy jayay gy۔ shrh alsn myn shrwa myn ayk azafh hay۔ anhwn nay kha: myn apnay wald kay sath rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky zyart kay lyay gya، jb myray wald nay dykha kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky pyth pr kya hay tw frmaya: mjhay as ka alaj krnay dw، kywnkh myn ayk tbyb hwn۔ as nay jwab dya، \mddgar tw hay، lykn khda tbyb hay۔\""* *yany aap mdd awr mshwrh dynay myn nrmy say kam krtay hyn، lykn srf allh hy alaj kr skta hay۔"""""
"3472","amrw by۔ shayb nay apnay wald ky trf say kha kh an kay dada nay btaya kh swrqh by۔ malk nay kha kh jb khda kay rswl nay ayk bap kw apnay bytay say antqam lynay ky ajazt dy tw wh whan mwjwd thay، lykn bytay kw apnay bap say antqam lynay ky ajazt nhyn dy۔ trmzy nay asay zayf qrar dytay hwyay nql kya hay۔"
"3473","amam hsn nay smwra kay hwalay say rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ka yh frman nql kya kh agr kwyy apnay ghlam kw qtl kray ga tw hm asay qtl kr dyn gay awr agr kwyy apnay ghlam kw mazwr kr day ga tw hm asay mazwr kr dyn gay۔ asay trmzy، abwdaod، abn majh awr darmy nay rwayt kya hay، awr nsayy nay ayk awr rwayt myn yh azafh kya hay kh \agr kwyy apnay ghlam kw zayl kray ga tw hm asay qtl kr dyn gay۔\"""""""
"3474","amrw by shayb nay apnay wald ky snd say byan kya kh an kay dada nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh agr kwyy ksy kw jan bwjh kr qtl kray tw asay mqtwl kay rshth darwn kay hwalay kr dya jayay، agr wh chahyn tw asay qtl kr dyn، lykn agr chahyn tw khwn bha lyn، jw an kay chwthay sal myn tys awntnyan hyn، an kay chwthay sal myn tys awntnyan hyn۔ jw antzam wh as kay sath krtay hyn wh an kay lyay fyslh krna hay۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"3475","aly rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tmam mslmanwn ky janyn brabr hyn، an myn say sb say zlyl an ky hfazt ky zmant day skta hay، sb say zyadh dwr wala dwsrwn kw as ky dy hwyy hfazt kw twrnay say rwk skta hay، awr wh ayk dwsray kay khlaf ayk grwh hyn، ksy mslman kw kafr ky wjh say qtl nhyn kya jana chahyay awr nh hy js say ahd lya gya hay asay as wqt qtl kya jayay jb tk as ka ahd qaym hw۔ asay abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3476","abn majh nay asay abn abas rzy allh anh say rwayt kya hay۔"
"3477","abw shryh khzaay rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay sna: ”agr ksy ka kwyy rshth dar mara jayay ya asay khbl lg jayay، yany zkhm hw tw wh tyn chyzwn myn say ksy ayk ka antkhab kr skta hay، lykn agr wh as say zyadh kchh chahta hay tw tm asay rwkw، wh bdlh lay skta hay، ya maaf kr skta hay، ya maawzh lay skta hay، lykn agr as nay an myn say ayk kw qbwl kr lya awr as kay bad as say zyadh mangay ga tw wh hmyshh kay lyay jayay ga۔ darymy nay asay mntql kya۔ * lfzy twr pr \chwtha۔\"""""""
"3478","taos nay abn abas rzy allh anhma say rwayt ky hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”agr kwyy ghlty say mara jayay jb lwg pthr mar rhay hwn، ya kwrwn say maryn ya lathy say maryn tw yh hadsaty hay awr naghany mwt ka maawzh wajb hay، lykn agr kwyy jan bwjh kr ksy kw mar dalay tw allh taalyٰ as pr lant kray ga، awr agr kwyy as pr lant kray ga tw allh taalyٰ as pr lant kray ga۔ awr as ky trf say nh tw astghfar qbwl kya jayay ga awr nh wajb۔\ asay abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔ *yh aysay waqaat hyn jn myn asl shkhs js nay asay qtl kya hay، wazh twr pr malwm nhyn hay، ya jhan qtl ka kwyy aradh nhyn tha۔"""""
"3479","jabr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myn ksy aysay shkhs kw maaf nhyn krwn ga jw khwn ky smjh kay bad qtl kray ga۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3480","hzrt abw drdaa rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna: ”ksy kw jsmany chwt nhyn phnchty awr as kw maaf nhyn kya jayay ga، bghyr as kay kh allh taalyٰ as kay lyay as ka kwyy drjh blnd kray awr as say ayk gnah mta day“۔ asay trmzy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔ * lfzy twr pr \asay sdqh kay twr pr dw۔\"""""""
"3481","sayd by۔ almsyb nay byan kya kh amr bn alkhtab nay ayk aadmy kay bdlay panch ya sat lwgwn kw qtl kya jsay anhwn nay khyant say qtl kya tha، amr nay kha۔ \agr ahl snaaa as kay khlaf sazsh krtay tw myn an sb kw qtl kr dyta۔\"" mlk nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"3482","bkhary nay abn amr rzy allh anh say asy trh ky rwayt nql ky hay۔"
"3483","jndb nay kha kh asay flan nay btaya tha kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \jw shkhs mara gya hay wh qyamt kay dn as kay qtl krnay walay kw layay ga awr khay ga kh as say pwchhw kh as nay mjhay kywn mara، awr wh khay ga kh myn nay asay flan mal ky wjh say qtl kya\""* jndb nay kha: as say bchw۔ nsayy nay asay nql kya hay۔ *as myn kchh shk hay kh yh lfz dwdh prhna hay ya mlk؟ mndrjh bala trjmh phlay ky pyrwy krta hay mokhr alzkr shyh prhnay ky zrwrt hay \""flan awr flan kay dwr myn\""۔ tahm، yh syaq w sbaq kay mtabq nhyn lgta hay۔"""""
"3484","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs ksy mwmn kay qtl myn aadhay klmay kay brabr bhy mdd kray ga tw wh allh say as ky pyshany pr ’’rhmt say maywsy‘‘ lkhay ga۔ asay abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔ * as ka mtlb yh lya jata hay kh aadhay lfz ka khna bhy ayk sngyn maamlh hay js myn mwmn kw qtl krnay ka aradh zahr hwta hay۔"
"3485","abn amr rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”agr kwyy aadmy ksy aadmy kw pkr lay awr dwsra asay qtl kr day tw js nay asay qtl kya wh qtl hw ga awr js nay pkra wh qyd hw ga۔ darqtny nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3486","abn abas rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”yh awr wh brabr hyn“ yany chhwty angly awr angwtha۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"3487","abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay fyslh dya kh jb by lhyan ky ayk awrt ka bchh mrdh pyda hwa tw as ka maawzh bhtryn ghlam ya ghlam kw dya jayay۔ phr js awrt kay khlaf as nay yh fyslh dya tha wh fwt hw gyy awr rswl allhﷺ nay fyslh dya kh as kay bytay awr shwhr as say wrast myn hwn awr as ka maawzh as kay rshth dar as kay bap ky trf say ada kryn۔ (bkhary w mslm) * lhyan qbylh hzyl ka ayk hsh thay، as lyay as rwayt ky wzaht as rwayt say hwskty hay jw agly rwaytwn myn hay۔ yh mhz ayk bchh mrdh pyda hwnay ky msal nhyn thy۔ yh dwsry awrt ky wjh say chwt ky wjh say tha."
"3488","anhwn nay kha kh hzyl ky dw awrtyn aaps myn lryn awr an myn say ayk nay dwsry pr pthr mara js say wh awr as kay pyt myn mwjwd dwnwn kw mar dala۔ phr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay fyslh dya kh as kay pyda hwnay walay bchay kay lyay khwn ky aql bhtryn mayar ky ghlam hw ya awrt، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay fyslh dya kh khwn ky aql ky zmh dar awrt kw apnay khwn ky aql ada krny chahyay، awr as kay bytwn awr an kay sath rhnay walwn kw as ka wars bna dya۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3489","almghyrh b۔ shabh nay byan kya kh dw awrtwn myn say ayk nay jw hm bywy thyn dwsry pr pthr ya khymh ka khmbh phynka js say asqat hml hwa، awr rswl allh nay fyslh dya kh asqat hml kay maawzh kay twr pr bhtryn qsm ka ayk mrd ya awrt dya jayay، awr aap nay asay wald ky trf say awrt kay rshth darwn kw ada krnay kay lyay mqrr kya۔ yh trmzy ka nskhh hay۔ dfah 1 myn srf bkhary ya mslm ky rwayat hwny chahyyn، lykn yhan trmzy ka nskhh phlay dya gya hay۔ mslm kay wrzhn myn as nay kha kh ayk awrt nay apny sathy bywy kw khymay kay khmbay say mara jb wh hamlh thy awr asay qtl kr dya، an myn say ayk ka talq lhyan say tha۔ anhwn nay kha kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay as awrt kay lyay khwn kw aql bnaya js nay asay qtl krnay waly awrt kay aabayy rshth darwn kay hathwn qtl kya awr as kay rhm myn mwjwd bchay ka maawzh bhtryn mayar ka ghlam bnaya۔ mslman"
"3490","abdallh by amrw rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”ghyr arady qtl kay lyay khwn ky aql jw amdaً hw، jysay kwray awr lathy say ky jaty hay، sw awntnyan hyn jn myn say chalys hamlh hyn۔ nsayy، abn majh awr darmy nay asay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3491","Abu Dawud ne isay unke (Rawi) aur Ibn Umar (Radi Allahu Anhuma) ke hawalay se riwayat kiya. Sharh as-Sunnah mein Masabih ke alfaz Ibn Umar (Radi Allahu Anhuma) ki riwayat ke mutabiq hain."
"3492","abwbkr b۔ mhmd by amrw by۔ hzm nay apnay wald kay hwalay say kha kh an kay dada nay btaya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay ymn kay lwgwn kw kht lkha tha awr an kay kht myn drj zyl alfaz thay: \agr kwyy ksy mwmn kw nahq qtl kray tw asay as kay hath kay kyay ka bdlh dyna chahyay، ala yh kh maray janay walay kay lwahqyn as kay lyay tyar nh hwn۔\"" as myn yh bhy kha gya kh ayk mrd kw awrt kay bdlay myn qtl kya ja skta hay۔ kh zndgy kay lyay khwn ky aql sw awnt hay۔ kh jn kay pas swna hay wh hzar dynar ada kryn۔ kh nak katnay kay bdlay sw awntwn kay khwn ky qymt ada krny hwgy۔ kh dantwn، hwntwn، khsywn، azw tnasl، ryrh ky hdy awr aankhwn kay lyay pwry aql ky qymt ada krny chahyay۔ kh ayk paon kay bdlay myn aadha khwn dyna pray ga، sr kay zkhm kay bdlay myn khwn ky aql ka thayy hsh، as zwr kay lyay jw bdn myn dakhl hw jayay khwn ky aql ka thayy hsh، sr kay zkhm kay lyay jw hdy kw hta day pndrh awnt، hr ayk angly awr pyr kay awz ds awnt، awr dant kay lyay panch awnt۔ nsayy awr darmy nay asay nql kya hay۔ malk ky rwayt myn hay: aankh kay bdlay pchas، hath kay lyay pchas، paon kay lyay pchas، awr as zkhm kay lyay jw panchwn ky hdywn kw nnga krta hay۔"""""
"3493","amrw by۔ shayb nay apnay wald kay hwalay say byan kya kh an kay dada nay kha kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay yh fyslh dya hay kh hr zkhm kay bdlay panch awnt ada kyay jayyn gay js say hdy khlty hay awr hr dant kay bdlay panch awnt۔ abwdaod، nsayy awr darmy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr trmzy awr abn majh nay phla hsh nql kya hay۔"
"3494","abn abas rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm anglywn awr anglywn kw brabr smjhtay thay۔ asay abwdaod awr trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3495","anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh aap nay frmaya: \anglyan awr anglyan brabr hyn، 1 dant brabr hyn، aglay dant awr darh kay dant brabr hyn، yh awr wh brabr hyn۔\"" abwdaod nay asay rwayt kya hay۔ 1۔ as rwayt myn srf asaby hy dy gyy hay، jb kh hath paon ky asaby as say phlay byan hwyy hay۔ wazh twr pr yhan as ka mtlb anglywn awr anglywn dwnwn say hwna chahyay۔ 2. yh tjwyz kya gya hay kh \""yh awr wh\"" srf chhwty angly awr angwthay say mrad hay (bab ky phly rwayt)، lykn yhan as say phlay samnay walay dant awr darh kay dant ka hwalh dya ja skta hay js ka as say phlay zkr kya gya hay۔"""""
"3496","**Amr bin Shu'aib (Radi Allahu Anhu)** apne walid aur dada kay hawalay se riwayat karte hain ke Allah kay Rasool (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Fath-e-Makka ke saal ek khutbe mein farmaya: \Aye logo! Islam mein naya iqrar (confederacy) nahi hai"","" lekin jo iqrar jaahiliyat ke zamane mein thay woh Islam ne aur mazboot kar diye. Musalmaan doosron ke muqable mein ek hi jamat hain. Unka sab se neecha (bhi kisi ko panah dene mein) sab ki taraf se zimma daar hai. Unka door daraz ka shakhs bhi maal-e-ghanimat wapas karta hai"","" aur unki jungo ki jamatein ghar walo ko maal-e-ghanimat wapas karti hain. Koi musalmaan kisi kafir ke badle mein qatal nahi kiya jayega. Kafir ki diyah (khoon baha) aadhi hai musalman ki diyah se. Zakaat ke liye janwaron ko nahi bulaya jayega aur na unhein chara gaah se hata kar laaya jayega"","" balke sadqaat gharo mein hi hasil ki jayengi.\"" Aur ek riwayat mein hai: \""Zimmi ki diyah aadhi hai azaad aadmi ki diyah se.\"" (Abu Dawud)."""""
"3497","khshf b۔ malk nay abn msawd ky rwayt say kha hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay fyslh dya kh naghany qtl kay lyay khwn ky aql bys madh awr bys nr awnt hwn jw dwsray sal myn dakhl hwn، bys awntnyan jw tysray sal myn dakhl hwn، bys awntnyan panchwyn sal myn awr chwbys awntnyan panchwyn sal myn hwn۔ asay trmzy، abwdaod awr nsayy nay nql kya hay lykn shyh qwl yh hay kh yh abn msawd say aagay nhyn jata۔ khshf namalwm hay، srf asy rwayt say jana jata hay۔ shrh alsn myn hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay khybr myn qtl hwnay walwn ka khwn sdqh kay awntwn say ada kya، lykn nr awnt jw dwsray sal myn dakhl hw chka hay wh sdqh kay awntwn ky amrwn myn shaml nhyn hay، srf nr awnt jw tysray sal myn dakhl hw chka hay۔"
"3498","amrw by۔ shayb nay apnay wald ky snd say kha kh an kay dada nay btaya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay zmanay myn aql ky qymt aath sw dynar ya aath hzar drhm thy awr as wqt ahl ktab ka khwn mslmanwn kay mqablay myn aadha tha۔ as nay kha kh amr rzy allh anh kay khlyfh hwnay tk lga، awr as nay ayk tqryr ky js myn kha kh awnt pyaray hw gyay hyn۔ chnanchh amr rzy allh anh nay swna rkhnay walwn ky qymt ayk hzar dynar، chandy rkhnay walwn ky qymt barh hzar، mwyshy rkhnay walwn ky dw sw gayyn، bhyr bkryan rkhnay walwn ky qymt dw hzar awr kpray rkhnay walwn ky dw sw swt mqrr ky۔ lykn as nay kha kh as nay khwn ky aql kw zmywn kay lyay chhwr dya jysa kh tha، asay khwn ky aql myn azafay kay tnasb say nhyn brhaya۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔ *yany drhm"
"3499","abn abas rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay aql kw barh hzar mqrr kya، trmzy، abwdaod، nsayy awr darmy nay asay rwayt kya hay۔ *yany drhm"
"3500","amrw by۔ shayb nay apnay wald ky snd say kha kh an kay dada nay btaya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay qsaby mwt kay lyay char sw dynar ya as kay brabr chandy shhr walwn kay lyay mqrr kr dy thy awr aap sly allh alyh wslm asay awntwn ky qymt kay hsab say mqrr kr rhay thay، as lyay jb wh azyz thay tw anhwn nay ada ky janay waly rqm myn azafh kr dya awr jb ssty hwyy tw km kr dy۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay zmanay myn wh char sw say aath sw dynar tk phnchtay thay، chandy myn an kay brabr aath hzar drhm thay۔ anhwn nay kha kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay fyslh dya kh mwyshy rkhnay walwn kw dw sw gayyn awr jn kay pas bhyryn hyn dw hzar bkryan ada kryn۔ as nay kha kh khwn ky aql kw qtl hwnay walay kay wrsa kw wrast myn mlna chahyay awr as nay fyslh dya kh awrt kay lyay khwn ky aql as kay bap ky trf say as kay rshth darwn myn tqsym ky jayay، lykn qatl kw kchh bhy nhyn mlna chahyay۔ asay abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3501","as nay apnay wald ky snd say kha kh an kay dada nay nby krym sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh \jan bwjh kr qtl kay mshabht kay lyay khwn ky aql atny hy skht hay jtny jan bwjh kr qtl ky jayay، lykn mjrm kw qtl nhyn kya jayay ga۔\"" abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"""""
"3502","as nay apnay wald ky trf say kha kh an kay dada nay btaya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay yh fyslh dya hay kh aankh nh htanay ky swrt myn bynayy zaya hwnay pr khwn ky aql ka thayy hsh ada kya jayay۔ asay abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3503","mhmd by amrw nay abw slmh say rwayt kya kh abwhryrh rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay fyslh dya kh asqat hml kay lyay bhtryn ghlam ya ghwra ya khchr ada kya jayay۔ abwdaod nay asay rwayt kya awr kha kh yh rwayt hmad bn nay rwayt ky hay۔ slamh awr khald alwsty mhmd bn ky snd pr۔ amrw، lykn as nay \ya ghwray ya khchr\"" ka zkr nhyn kya۔"""""
"3504","amrw by۔ shayb nay apnay wald kay hwalay say kha kh an kay dada nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh: \jw kwyy dwa pr aml krta hay jb kh wh pryktyshnr kay twr pr nhyn jana jata tha، as ka zmh dar hwga۔\"" * abwdaod awr nsayy nay asay nql kya hay۔ *mryz kay mrnay ky swrt myn asay khwn ky qymt ada krny hwgy۔"""""
